RWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/common\">common</a></span> tongue.]\n</p><p><br>\nKobolds entering the area.\n</p><p>Pursuing <a href=\"/wiki/Dragon\" title=\"Dragon\">dragon</a>.\n</p><p>Threat posed: minimal.\n</p><p>Suggested course of action: ignore.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234324\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2410/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37993/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11106/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 988338/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.053      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.053      1 -total\n 67.72%   31.186     11 Template:Icon_text\n 59.25%   27.287     25 Template:Trim\n 32.25%   14.850      6 Template:Icon_link\n 31.94%   14.709      1 Template:PageSeo\n 31.84%   14.662      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.29%   11.188      2 Template:CharLink\n 19.65%    9.048     11 Template:Ifempty\n 17.67%    8.138      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12565-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714234324 and revision id 343682. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}